{"id": "EUVD-2026-101130", "enisaUuid": "eb02f1dd-0eb8-34c6-9b3c-b9fad5cf8fe9", "description": "Khronos NNEF-Tools nnef through 1.0.10 and nnef-tools through 1.0.11 contain a path traversal vulnerability that allows attackers to write files outside the model directory via crafted variable labels. Attackers can supply a graph.nnef with '../' sequences or absolute paths in labels to create or overwrite '.dat' files when users convert, save, or generate weights.", "datePublished": "2026-10-14T15:01:23", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T17:39:15", "baseScore": 4.8, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@1ExmmukzRMWN7B4gQ4W-4Q/SJiYagajfe", "https://github.com/KhronosGroup/NNEF-Tools/blob/0bb9c04fcf69c19e0aefa1ba9bf65f05478c8f81/nnef-pyproject/nnef/__init__.py#L87", "https://github.com/KhronosGroup/NNEF-Tools", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/khronos-nnef-tools-nnef-through-1.0.10-and-nnef-tools-through-1.0.11-path-traversal-via-variable-label"], "aliases": ["GHSA-3m64-wpw6-whjx", "CVE-2026-110657"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.24, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "01a24653-e920-3ad3-aabb-1fe07d1f86bf", "product": {"name": "nnef-tools", "vendor": {"name": "Khronos Group"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.0.11"}, {"id": "95f4d0da-c42d-3628-a90f-eef7465ec7e1", "product": {"name": "nnef", "vendor": {"name": "Khronos Group"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.0.10"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "4998aff4-98de-36b4-ac51-817e7ff209b9", "vendor": {"name": "Khronos Group"}}], "isExploited": false}